<title>NETHERLANDS: PAKHOED 1996 NET PROFIT NLG 75.5 MLN.</title>
<headline>PAKHOED 1996 NET PROFIT NLG 75.5 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>ROTTERDAM 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yr to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Total net profit		    75.5  vs 121.5</p>
<p>    Net per shr (guilders)	     2.40 vs   4.00</p>
<p>    Net from ordinary operations   138.3  vs 123.6</p>
<p>    Dividend (guilders)		  1.80 vs   1.80</p>
<p>    Turnover (billions)		  3.59 vs   2.07</p>
<p>    Operating profit		   234.2  vs 210.4</p>
<p>    Extraordinary charge		62.2  vs   2.1</p>
<p>    Interest charges		    55.3  vs  42.8</p>
<p>    Tax				     40.6  vs  44.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Shipping and tank storage group Koninklijke Pakhoed</p>
<p>NV was expected by analysts to produce a 1996 net profit from</p>
<p>ordinary operations of between 125 and 140 million guilders.</p>
<p>BREAKDOWN OF HALF-YEAR RESULTS --</p>
<p>					     H2 1996   H1 1996  H2 1995</p>
<p>    Total net profit		    70.9	 4.6	 60.1</p>
<p>    Net from ordinary operations    79.4	58.9	 61.6</p>
<p>    Operating profit		   142.9	91.3	100.1</p>
<p>NOTE - The Amsterdam stock exchange Artemis news service had</p>
<p>originally stated an incorrect second half net profit of 4.6</p>
<p>million guilders. It later corrected this to 70.9 million.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
